--[[
    AETHER PRIME  v4.0   (Luau / Roblox)
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    New in v4
      * Brilliant / Gambit detection  (sacrifice + unexpected + pays off)
      * Opponent model: rates every opponent move, learns their weak spots
        (hangs pieces, misses tactics, weak phase, cracks under pressure...)
        and the "Adaptive" style changes how the engine plays against them
      * Positional weak-spot scanner (loose pieces, pins, weak king, back rank,
        isolated/doubled pawns...) + "Hunt" eval that pressures those squares
      * Tactics: sacrifice-aware search, quiet-check qsearch, recapture and
        passed-pawn extensions, fork / mate-in-1 / win-material finder
      * Gambit opening book (King's, Evans, Danish, Smith-Morra, Budapest...)
      * Anti-lag: self-tuning frame budget (slice shrinks if your FPS drops),
        think time counts only CPU time, not the frames we yielded
      * Pondering: thinks on the opponent's time (default 30s) in tiny slices,
        predicts the reply, warms the shared hash table, "ponder hit" = instant
        deep move
]]

